sequenceDiagram
  participant P0 as Uploader
  participant P1 as Metadata
  participant P2 as Worker
  participant P3 as Storage
  P0->>P1: Complete uploaded object
  P1->>P3: Verify source checksum
  P1->>P2: Schedule rendition job
  P2->>P3: Write immutable renditions
  P3->>P2: Stored checksums
  P2->>P1: All required outputs valid
  P1->>P3: Publish versioned manifest
  P1->>P0: Ready for authorized playback
